# fdfpv-backup.timer: fdfpv-backup.service every night at 04:30 local time,
# the quietest hour on the rooms. Persistent, so a night the desktop was off
# is caught up when it next starts.
#
# This file is part of the Paraguayan Drone Combat Simulator.
#
